From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 11:10:27 -0647
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: phy: google,zuma-pcie-phy: Add zumapro as a
 fallback of zuma

zumapro (Tensor G4, Pixel 9a) has zuma's one-lane Gen3 PHY on its Wi-Fi
PCIe controller, at the same addresses (PMA 0x13160000, PCS 0x13140000,
UDBG 0x13150000, SOC 0x13130000) and with the PMU's PHY control at the
same offset (0x3ec8). Google builds one CAL file,
pcie-exynos-zuma-rc-cal.c, for both SoCs, and its channel 1 sequence is
the one this binding's driver programs, register for register.

Describe zumapro as "google,zumapro-pcie-phy", "google,zuma-pcie-phy".

Tested on a Pixel 9a with this pair of compatibles: phy-zuma-pcie
reported the external PLL, PLL and CDR locked and offset calibration
done, and the link trained at Gen2 x1.

Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/phy/google,zuma-pcie-phy.yaml  | 10 ++++++++--
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/google,zuma-pcie-phy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/google,zuma-pcie-phy.yaml
index 8003eb7b5..544df73eb 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/google,zuma-pcie-phy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/google,zuma-pcie-phy.yaml
@@ -14,11 +14,17 @@ description:
   PCIe controller, which connects the Wi-Fi chip on Pixel 8 phones. Its
   reference clock comes from an external PLL in the UDBG block, selected as
   the PHY's input clock in the controller's SOC block. The PMU isolates the
-  PHY until it is released.
+  PHY until it is released. zumapro (Tensor G4) has the same PHY for its
+  Wi-Fi controller, programmed with the same sequence, so it uses zuma's
+  compatible as a fallback.
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    const: google,zuma-pcie-phy
+    oneOf:
+      - const: google,zuma-pcie-phy
+      - items:
+          - const: google,zumapro-pcie-phy
+          - const: google,zuma-pcie-phy
 
   reg:
     items:
